# Line endings. Every text file is LF in the repository AND in every checkout,
# Windows included. Git for Windows otherwise checks text out with CRLF, and
# three things here read files by their bytes or line by line: the schema
# reader (the list of deprecated tabs), migration checksums, and the shell
# script the local database container runs. The code tolerates CRLF too
# (found on the first dry run, Nov 27); this keeps the files the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Data files stay exactly as committed.
*.csv -text
*.png binary
*.xlsx binary
